1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,000
[VAN ENGINE HUMMING]

2
00:00:03,033 --> 00:00:06,633
[VAN DOOR SLIDES OPEN]

3
00:00:07,233 --> 00:00:08,367
[JUNE] Thank you.

4
00:00:08,367 --> 00:00:10,367
[VAN DOOR SLIDES SHUT]

5
00:00:13,433 --> 00:00:16,067
Uh, can I help you
with something?

6
00:00:18,367 --> 00:00:19,367
Uh...

7
00:00:20,267 --> 00:00:22,633
Is Ping there?

8
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:25,567
I'm Toto, his brother.

9
00:00:25,567 --> 00:00:26,733
Hmm!

10
00:00:26,733 --> 00:00:30,167
I'm June,
your brother's fiancée.

11
00:00:30,633 --> 00:00:32,400
Would you like to come inside?

12
00:00:32,400 --> 00:00:33,500
Ah...

13
00:00:33,500 --> 00:00:35,700
Is Ping home?

14
00:00:35,733 --> 00:00:38,100
No, he just left.

15
00:00:38,100 --> 00:00:40,167
He said he had
a meeting somewhere.

16
00:00:40,167 --> 00:00:41,433
Come on, you can wait
for him inside.

17
00:00:41,433 --> 00:00:43,200
Oh! No, no. it's okay.

18
00:00:43,200 --> 00:00:45,333
I shouldn't have
come here anyway.

19
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,400
Just don't tell Ping
I stopped by.

20
00:00:47,700 --> 00:00:49,000
Why not?

21
00:00:49,367 --> 00:00:50,633
Don't you know?

22
00:00:53,767 --> 00:00:55,367
I'm embarrassed.

23
00:00:56,200 --> 00:00:58,033
I caused him so much trouble.

24
00:00:59,733 --> 00:01:02,767
I was really desperate
back then,

25
00:01:02,767 --> 00:01:06,267
and loan sharks were after me.

26
00:01:06,700 --> 00:01:09,300
I was so scared for my life

27
00:01:10,100 --> 00:01:12,200
that I ended up stealing
from his company.

28
00:01:12,667 --> 00:01:17,067
[GLUM MUSIC PLAYING]

29
00:01:17,067 --> 00:01:18,533
Just explain everything to him.

30
00:01:18,533 --> 00:01:21,300
I'm sure your brother
will understand.

31
00:01:21,300 --> 00:01:23,300
That's one of the reasons
I fell in love with him.

32
00:01:23,300 --> 00:01:25,567
He really cares
about his family.

33
00:01:25,800 --> 00:01:26,933
[SIGHS]

34
00:01:26,933 --> 00:01:29,100
They're going to charge me
with fraud.

35
00:01:29,467 --> 00:01:30,700
They're going
to send me to jail

36
00:01:30,700 --> 00:01:33,533
because he doesn't want to
be embarrassed at his company.

37
00:01:33,533 --> 00:01:35,233
I don't know
what to do anymore!

38
00:01:35,467 --> 00:01:38,567
And not every family looks out
for each other like yours does.

39
00:01:38,567 --> 00:01:41,500
Some families even drag
their own relatives down.

40
00:01:41,533 --> 00:01:48,500
[GLUM MUSIC CONTINUES]

41
00:02:00,100 --> 00:02:01,233
[METAL GATE OPENS]

42
00:02:03,867 --> 00:02:10,533
[MUSIC BECOMES SINISTER]

43
00:02:10,533 --> 00:02:11,500
[PHONE BEEPS]

44
00:02:11,800 --> 00:02:13,500
[LINE RINGING]

45
00:02:13,500 --> 00:02:15,167
I've ruined Ping's reputation.

46
00:02:15,500 --> 00:02:16,633
I've done my part.

47
00:02:16,633 --> 00:02:18,633
Now pay back
what I owe the company

48
00:02:18,633 --> 00:02:21,500
and make sure
I don't end up in jail.

49
00:02:21,500 --> 00:02:28,433
[SINISTER MUSIC CONTINUES]
